{"id":"book-viii-translator-and-historical-edition-notes-part-8","label":"Book VIII — Translator and historical edition notes (part 8)","headingNoteRefs":"","context":"Book VIII","kind":"commentary","blocks":[{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1217]: φιλολόγων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1217"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1218]: 1 Cor. ii. 4, 5 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1218"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1219]: Such is the reading of the Septuagint version. The Masoretic text has: “The Lord gave a word; of them who published it there was a great host.” [Cf. Ps. lxviii. 11 . S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1219"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1220]: Cf. Rom. i. 18–23 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1220"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1221]: ἐκ πολλῆς συνουσίας γινομένης περὶ τὸ πρᾶγμα αὐτὸ, καὶ τοῦ συζῇν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1221"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1222]: Cf. Plato, Phædo [lxvi. p. 118. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1222"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1223]: καὶ τὰ ἀόρατα τοῦ Θεοῦ, καὶ τὰς ἰδέας φαντασθέντες ἀπὸ τῆς κτίσεως τοῦ κόσμου, καὶ τῶν αἰσθητῶν, ἀφ᾽ ὧν ἀναβαίνουσιν ἐπὶ τὰ νοούμενα· τὴν τε ἀΐδιον αὐτοῦ δύναμιν καὶ θειότητα οὐκ ἀγεννῶς ἰδόντες , etc.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1223"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1224]: Rom. i. 25 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1224"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1225]: Cf. 1 Cor. i. 27, 28, 29 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1225"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1226]: ἐπιτηδείοις .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1226"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1227]: καὶ τίνι τῶν ἐν ἡμῖν . Boherellus understands ὅμοιος , which has been adopted in the translation.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1227"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1228]: Cf. Matt. v. 8 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1228"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1229]: Hos. x. 12 . φωτίσατε ἑαυτοῖς φῶς γνώσεως (LXX.). The Masoretic text is, תע“וְ רינִ סכֶלָ וּרינִ , where for תע“וְ ( and time ) the Septuagint translator apparently read תעַדַּ ( knowledge ), ד and ו being interchanged for their similarity.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1229"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1230]: Cf. John i. 3, 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1230"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1231]: τὸν ἀληθινὸν καὶ νοητόν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1231"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1232]: Cf. 2 Cor. iv. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1232"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1233]: Ps. xxvii. 1 (attributed to David).","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1233"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1234]: Ps. cxix. 105 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1234"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1235]: Ps. iv. 6 (Heb. “Lift up upon us,” etc.)","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1235"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1236]: Ps. xxxvi. 9 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1236"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1237]: Cf. Isa. lx. 1 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1237"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1238]: Cf. Isa. ix. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1238"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1239]: Cf. Isa. ix. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1239"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1240]: ἐνθουσιᾷν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1240"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1241]: Cf. Matt. xxv. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1241"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1242]: κεφαλίδα βιβλίου .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1242"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1243]: οὐαί : cf. Ezek. ii. 9, 10 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1243"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1244]: Cf. Rev. x. 9 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1244"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1245]: 2 Cor. xii. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1245"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1246]: Cf. Rev. x. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1246"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1247]: πολλάκις δὲ ἤδη ὁ Κέλσος θρυλλήσας ὡς ἀξιούμενον εὐθέως πιστεύειν, ὡς καινόν τι παρὰ τὰ πρότερον εἰρημένα . Guietus thus amends the passage: πολλάκις δὲ ἤδη ὁ Κέλσος ἀξιούμενος εὐθέως πιστεύειν, ὡς καινόν τι παρὰ τὰ πρότερον εἰρημένα θρυλλήσας , etc. Boherellus would change ἀξιούμενον into ἀξιοῦμεν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1247"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1248]: παιδεία ἀνεξέλεγκτος πλανᾶται : cf. Prov. x. 17 (Sept.).","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1248"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1249]: γνῶσις ἀσυνέτου ἀδιεξέταστοι λόγοι : cf. Ecclus. xxi. 18 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1249"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1250]: οὐ τερατεύεται .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1250"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1251]: The night before Ariston brought Plato to Socrates as his pupil, the latter dreamed that a swan from the altar of Cupid alighted on his bosom. Cf. Pausanias in Atticis , p. 58.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1251"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1252]: “Alicubi forsan occurrit: me vero uspiam legisse non memini. Credo Platonem per tertium oculum suam πολυμάθειαν et scientiam, quâ ceteris anteibat, denotare voluisse.”— Spencer .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1252"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1253]: Plato, Epist ., vi.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1253"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1254]: ὧν ἓν μὲν ὄνομα· δεύτερον δὲ λόγος· τὸ δὲ τρίτον εἴδωλον· τὸ τέταρτον δὲ ἐπιστήμη .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1254"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1255]: τρανότερον φήσομεν ἐν τῇ ψυχῇ γινόμενον μετὰ τὸν λόγον τῶν τραυμάτων τύπον, τοῦτον εἶναι τὸν ἑν ἑκάστῳ Χριστὸν, ἀπὸ Χριστοῦ Λόγου .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1255"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1256]: τὸ μηδέν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1256"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1257]: εἰκῆ πιστεύοντι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1257"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1258]: 1 Cor. xv. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1258"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1259]: [p. 41. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1259"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1260]: τοῦ δημιουργοῦ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1260"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1261]: Cf. Col. iv. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1261"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1262]: χθὲς καὶ πρώην .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1262"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1263]: κοινὸν δὲ πάντων ἢ καὶ πρόχειρον . For ἢ , Boherellus reads ᾖ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1263"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1264]: οἱ γὰρ ὁμοίως Κελσῷ ὑπολαβόντες τετερατεῦσθαι . The word ὁμοίως formerly stood, in the text of Spencer and Ruæus, before τετερατεῦθαι , but is properly expunged, as arising from the preceding ὁμοίως . Boherellus remarks: “Forte aliud quid exciderit, verbi gratiâ, τὰ τοῦ Ιησοῦ .”","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1264"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1265]: τερατεύσασθαι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1265"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1266]: τὸ οὐδέν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1266"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1267]: Cf. Acts viii. 10 [and vol. i. p. 187, this series].","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1267"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1268]: Cf. Acts v. 36, 37 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1268"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1269]: Cf. 1 Cor. iii. 19 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1269"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1270]: πεπλασμένον ἡμῖν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1270"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1271]: ἦθος γὰρ ἀνθρώπειον μὲν οὐκ ἔχει γνώμας, θεῖον δὲ ἔχει .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1271"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1272]: Cf. Plato’s Apolog ., v.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1272"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1273]: μετρίων ὄντων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1273"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1274]: Cf. Wisd. of Sol. ix. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1274"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1275]: τέλειοι .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1275"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1276]: Heb. v. 14 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1276"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1277]: Ps. xlix. 9, 10 . (LXX.).","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1277"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1278]: γνῶσις .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1278"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1279]: 1 Cor. xii. 8, 9 . [See Gieseler’s Church History , on “The Alexandrian Theology,” vol. i. p. 212. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1279"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1280]: τοὺς μὴ αἰσχυνομένους ἐν τῷ τοῖς ἀψύχοις προσλαλεῖν, καὶ περὶ μὲν ὑγείας τὸ ἀσθενὲς ἐπικαλουμένους, περὶ δὲ ζωῆς τὸ νεκρὸν ἀξιοῦντας, περὶ δὲ ἐπικουρίας τὸ ἀπορώτατον ἱκετεύοντας .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1280"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1281]: βαναύσων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1281"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1282]: τοὺς ἐσχάτους .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1282"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1283]: γόητας .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1283"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1284]: προτροπάδ῾ν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1284"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1285]: τοὺς χαριεστέρους .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1285"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1286]: παλεύομεν . [See note supra , p. 482. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1286"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1287]: Cf. 1 Cor. i. 26 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1287"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1288]: ὡς περιηχηθεὶς τὰ περὶ ταπεινοφροσύνης .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1288"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1289]: μὴ ἐπιμελῶς αὐτὴν νοήσας .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1289"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1290]: εὐθείᾳ περαίνει κατὰ φύσιν παραπορευόμενος .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1290"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1291]: Plato, de Legibus , iv. p. 716.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1291"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1292]: Ps. cxxxi. 1, 2 (LXX.). The clause, “If I had not been humble,” seems to belong to the following verse.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1292"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1293]: τῇ ἰδιωτείᾳ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1293"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1294]: τῇ ἰδιωτείᾳ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1294"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1295]: διὰ τὸν ἰδιωτισμόν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1295"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1296]: Cf. Phil. ii. 6, 8 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1296"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1297]: Cf. Matt. xi. 20 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1297"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1298]: Cf. Matt. xix. 24 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1298"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1299]: Cf. Plato, de Legibus , v. p. 743.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1299"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1300]: Cf. Matt. xiii. 54, Mark vi. 2, and John vii. 15 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1300"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1301]: Cf. Matt. vii. 14 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1301"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1302]: Cf. Ps. xviii. 11 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1302"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1303]: Cf. Ex. xx. 21 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1303"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1304]: Cf. Ex. xxiv. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1304"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1305]: Cf. Ps. civ. 6 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1305"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1306]: Cf. Matt. xi. 27 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1306"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1307]: ἀγένητον . Locus diligenter notandus, ubi Filius e creaturarum numero diserte eximitur, dum ἀγένητος dicitur. At non dissimulandum in unico Cod. Anglicano secundo legi: τὸν γεννητόν : cf. Origenianorum , lib. ii. quæstio 2, num. 23.— Ruæus .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1307"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1308]: [Bishop Bull, in the Defensio Fidei Nicenæ , book ii. cap. ix. 9, says, “In these words, which are clearer than any light, Origen proves the absolutely divine and uncreated nature of the Son.” S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1308"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1309]: ὅ τι ποτ᾽ ἂν χωρῇ γιγνώσκειν . Boherellus proposes ὅστις ποτ᾽ ἂν χωρῇ , etc.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1309"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1310]: Cf. Plato, Epist ., ii., ad Dionys.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1310"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1311]: Cf. Isa. vi. 2 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1311"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1312]: Cf. Ezek. i. and x .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1312"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1313]: Ps. cxlviii. 4 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1313"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1314]: Cf. Plato in Phædro , p. 247.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1314"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1315]: Cf. 2 Cor. iv. 17, 18 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1315"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1316]: Cf. John xiv. 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1316"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1317]: πρὸς ἄκροις τοῖς οὐρανοῖς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1317"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1318]: ποταμοὺς τῶν θεωρήματων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1318"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1319]: For ὅσον γε Boherellus proposes ὅσοι γε , which is adopted in the translation.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1319"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1320]: Cf. 1 Cor. xiii. 12 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1320"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1321]: Cf. 1 Cor. xiii. 10 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1321"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1322]: [Bishop Pearson, in his Exposition of the Creed , Art. IX., notes that “Origen for the most part speaks of the Church in the plural number, αι ἐκκλησίαι .” S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1322"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1323]: [But see 2 Cor. xii. 2 , and also Irenæus, vol. i. p. 405.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1323"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1324]: Cf. Plato in Timæo , p. 42.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1324"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1325]: Cf. Gen. xxviii. 12, 13 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1325"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1326]: ἐπεστηριγμένον .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1326"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1327]: τῆς τε ἀπλανοῦς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1327"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1328]: κλίμαξ ἱψίπυλος . Boherellus conjectures ἑπτάπυλος .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1328"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1329]: κεραστοῦ νομίσματος .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1329"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1330]: τὴν χαλκοβάτην καὶ στεῤῥάν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1330"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1331]: τλήμονα γὰρ ἔργων ἁπάντων, καὶ χρηματιστὴν, καὶ πολύκμητον εἶναι, τόν τε σίδηρον καὶ τὸν ῾Ερμῆν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1331"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1332]: τῆς λοιπῆς ὕλης . For ὕλης , another reading is πύλης .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1332"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1333]: For ὡς ἐκείνοις ἀρκεῖσθαι , Spencer introduced into his text, οὐδ᾽ ἐκείνοις ἀρκεῖσθαι , which has been adopted in the translation.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1333"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1334]: ἐν οἷς πολλοὶ σεμνύνονται .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1334"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1335]: ἀπὸ τῆς συγκλήτου βουλῆς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1335"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1336]: Cf. Ezek. xlviii .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1336"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1337]: ἐπὶ τὰ κρείττονα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1337"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1338]: Cf. Rev. xxi .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1338"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1339]: θεωρήματα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1339"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1340]: [Vol. i. p. 354, this series.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1340"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1341]: “Utinam exstaret! Multum enim lucis procul dubio antiquissimorum Patrum libris, priscæ ecclesiæ temporibus, et quibusdam sacræ Scripturæ locis, accederet.”— Spencer .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1341"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1342]: κατὰ τὸ φιλομαθὲς ἡμῶν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1342"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1343]: Cf. 2 Tim. iii. 6, 7 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1343"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1344]: Cf. note in Spencer’s edition.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1344"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1345]: παίγνιον .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1345"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1346]: Cf. Ps. civ. 24–26 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1346"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1347]: Cf. Mal. iii. 2, 3 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1347"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1348]: χωνευομένων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1348"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1349]: ποῦ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1349"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1350]: Cf. Zech. v. 7 .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1350"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1351]: [See Dean Plumptre’s The Spirits in Prison , on “The Universalism of Origen,” p. 137, et seqq. S.]","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1351"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1352]: μάτην ἐκκείμενα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1352"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1353]: ἀλλόκοτα καὶ ἀμοιβαίας φωνάς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1353"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1354]: ἀρχοντικῶν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1354"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1355]: οὐκ εὔγνωμον ἀλλά…πάνυ ἀγνωμονέστατον .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1355"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1356]: φύρων δὲ τὰ πράγματα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1356"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1357]: συνέδριον .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1357"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1358]: μέτριος τὰ ἤθη .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1358"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1359]: ἀρχηγοῦ τῶν καλῶν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1359"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1360]: ᾽Οφιᾶνοι : cf. Irenæus, vol. i. pp. 354–358.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1360"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1361]: τὴν εὐτέλειαν ἀγαπήσας .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1361"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1362]: ἀπὸ τῆς παντελοῦς ἀκτημοσύνης .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1362"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1363]: “Euphraten hujus hæresis auctorem solus Origenes tradit.”— Spencer ; cf. note in Spencer’s edition.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1363"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1364]: ἀναισθήτου .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1364"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1365]: Boherellus proposes φῇς for the textual reading φησί .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1365"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1366]: καὶ τοῖς προφήταις ἐμπνέοντα .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1366"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1367]: ὅταν δὲ τὰ ἐναντία ὁ σὸς διδάσκαλος ᾽Ιησοῦς, καὶ ὁ ᾽Ιουδαίων Μωϋσῆς, νομοθετῇ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1367"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1368]: ψυχικόν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1368"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1369]: Cf. Spencer’s note, as quoted in Benedictine edition.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1369"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1370]: “Nescio, an hæresium Scriptores hujus Thauthabaoth, Erataoth, Thaphabaoth, Onoeles, et Thartharaoth, usquam meminerint. Hujus generis vocabula innumera invenies apud Epiphan., Hær ., 31, quæ est Valentinianorum, pp. 165–171.”— Spencer .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1370"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1371]: φραγμὸν κακίας .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1371"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1372]: πύλας ἀρχόντων αἰῶνι δεδεμένας .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1372"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1373]: μονότροπον .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1373"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1374]: λήθην ἀπερίσκεπτον .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1374"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1375]: ᾽Ογδοάδος . Cf. Tertullian, de Præscript. adv. Hæreticos , cap. xxxiii. (vol. iii. p. 259), and other references in Benedictine ed.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1375"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1376]: Φαίνων . “Ea, quæ Saturni stella dicitur, φαινων que a Græcis dicitur.”— Cicero , de Nat. Deorum , book ii. c. 20.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1376"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1377]: συμπαθεῖν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1377"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1378]: νυκτοφαής .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1378"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1379]: πεντάδι δυνατωτέρᾳ .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1379"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1380]: μύστην .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1380"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1381]: χάριν κρυπτομένην δυνάμεσιν ἐξουσιῶν .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1381"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1382]: For καταλυθέν Boherellus conjectures καταγλυφθέν , which has been adopted in the translation.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1382"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1383]: φαντασίας .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1383"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1384]: ἀπατεώνων .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1384"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1385]: εἰς τὰς ἀρχοντικὰς μορφάς .","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1385"},{"text":"[^origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1386]: Guietus thinks that some word has been omitted here, as ξίφος , which seems very probable.","kind":"commentary","noteId":"origen-against-celsus-vi-ix-1386"}],"chars":13833,"notes":{}}
